{
  "info": {
    "name": "Keisya Week 10 - Product API",
    "description": "Koleksi pengujian CRUD Product API (Express + Prisma + PostgreSQL).\n\nCara pakai:\n1. Jalankan server: npm start\n2. Import file ini ke Postman.\n3. Pastikan variable baseUrl = http://localhost:3000\n4. Klik Send pada tiap request, atau jalankan collection secara berurutan.\n\nRequest POST sukses otomatis menyimpan ID produk baru ke variable productId, sehingga request PUT/GET/DELETE berikutnya memakai ID yang benar.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "createdProductId",
      "value": "3"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Products",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 - GET semua produk (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Response berupa array', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02 - GET produk by ID (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Ada field id, name, price', () => {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('id');",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('name');",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('price');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03 - GET produk tidak ditemukan (404)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/999999",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products",
                "999999"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "04 - GET ID tidak valid (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400 Bad Request', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/abc",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products",
                "abc"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
